[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2478049201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98786#issuecomment-2478049201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98786","id":2478049201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TtAex","user":{"login":"DarkyMago","id":6394371,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTQzNzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6394371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkyMago","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T06:24:53Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T06:25:52Z","body":"ran a profile on the issue :\r\n![godot_98786_profile](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/38d9a692-423b-4629-aba7-449f6dbf43af)\r\n\r\nSeems to be because the window notification mechanism is slow and maybe a lack of \"opt-out\" mechanism.\r\nBasically, when you get a window event as such, the whole Node hierarchy is notified recursively (`Window::_propagate_window_notification`), via a function with a thread guard (good).\r\n\r\nAs it's all done on a single frame (good), if you have millions of nodes into millions of others, that guarded recursion is bound to be slow.\r\n\r\nSo if Godot should handle such recursion (a voxel based-game is what comes to mind for such a case), it could be a good thing to neutralize this impact somewhat.\r\nA parameter could be introduced on Node to check if it should propagate the notification further down (propagating by default for compatibility).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2478049201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479312425","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98786#issuecomment-2479312425","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98786","id":2479312425,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tx04p","user":{"login":"DarkyMago","id":6394371,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzOTQzNzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6394371?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago","html_url":"https://github.com/DarkyMago","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarkyMago/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T16:03:36Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T16:03:44Z","body":"But again, in this case it might be more interesting to get into specific object management with [node alternatives](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/tutorials/best_practices/node_alternatives.html).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479312425/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]